                    According to the President’s Daily Diary, Kissinger placed the call at Nixon’s
                    request. (National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, White House Central
                    Files)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d98-f2" n="2" xml:id="d98-f2-content">
